              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;">
              <span style="font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;">⭐</span>
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;margin-bottom:2px;">5+ Years Experience</div>
                <div style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);line-height:1.5;">Proven track record in the field</div>
