        <a href="/post-project"
          style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;background:#E05A2B;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:13px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;">
          📋 Post Your Project Free
